; ROOSTER: the GL names this program answers for, each handed on to ANGLE
; (libGLESv2.dll). CMakeLists.txt reads the list twice: for the exports
; (name = libGLESv2.name), and for the import library the linker wants
; before it will write one.
;
; flutter_angle binds these functions with @Native and no library of their
; own, so the Dart VM looks each name up in every module of the process, in
; the order the modules were loaded, and keeps the first it finds. Flutter's
; engine (flutter_windows.dll) imports Windows' own OPENGL32.dll, which has
; four of them (glTexImage2D, glTexSubImage2D, glReadPixels and
; glDeleteTextures: OpenGL 1.1) and does nothing with a call when no WGL
; context is current. Whenever OPENGL32.dll was loaded before libGLESv2.dll,
; every texture Sunny Side Putt uploaded went there: the lawn, the rails, the
; flag and the eggs drew black or see-through and the shadows were gone.
; That was every start of v1.45.2 and v1.45.3, whose delay-loaded plugins
; came after the engine, and the first start after an update (or a build) of
; the others: Windows loads a libGLESv2.dll that was just written after
; OPENGL32.dll (14 starts of 14, measured), and before it otherwise.
;
; The program itself is the first module the VM asks, so with these names
; here the order no longer matters. Every name flutter_angle binds that way
; is listed, not only the four: unit_test/windows/angle_exports_test.dart
; fails when its bindings and this list part ways. See docs/sunny-side-putt.md.
LIBRARY libGLESv2
EXPORTS
  glBufferData
  glBufferSubData
  glCompressedTexImage2D
  glCompressedTexImage3D
  glCompressedTexSubImage2D
  glCompressedTexSubImage3D
  glDeleteBuffers
  glDeleteFramebuffers
  glDeleteRenderbuffers
  glDeleteTextures
  glDeleteTransformFeedbacks
  glDeleteVertexArrays
  glDrawBuffers
  glInvalidateFramebuffer
  glReadPixels
  glTexImage2D
  glTexImage3D
  glTexSubImage2D
  glTexSubImage3D
  glUniform1fv
  glUniform1iv
  glUniform1uiv
  glUniform2fv
  glUniform2iv
  glUniform2uiv
  glUniform3fv
  glUniform3iv
  glUniform3uiv
  glUniform4fv
  glUniform4iv
  glUniform4uiv
  glUniformMatrix2fv
  glUniformMatrix3fv
  glUniformMatrix4fv
  glVertexAttrib1fv
  glVertexAttrib2fv
  glVertexAttrib3fv
  glVertexAttrib4fv
